WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.900
Sprout here! Want to test something properly?

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:05.400
You get one rule.

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:06.780
Change one thing.

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:09.600
In a controlled experiment,

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.480
you change one thing on purpose:

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:13.080
the independent variable.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:14.480
You measure what happens:

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:15.820
the dependent variable.

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:17.940
And you keep everything else the same.

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:21.160
Does light affect plant growth?

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:23.300
Three pots. Two hours of light.

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:24.960
Six hours. Ten hours.

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:26.460
Light is what we change.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:27.780
Height is what we measure.

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:30.220
Same species. Same water.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:32.200
Same soil. Those stay locked.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.980
If I also gave the ten hour plant more water,

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:36.880
and it grew taller,

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.020
was it the light,

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:38.600
or the water?

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:39.540
I can't tell.

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:40.520
That's not a fair test.

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:44.640
Your turn. Does music help people remember words?

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:46.100
Some people hear music,

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:47.240
some sit in silence,

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:48.900
then everyone takes a word test.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:50.460
What's the independent variable?

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:51.840
Go.

00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:59.020
The music! That's what the researchers changed.

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:01.400
The test score is the dependent variable.

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:03.980
On the test,

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:04.700
ask two questions.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:06.060
What changed on purpose?

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:07.300
What got measured?

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.380
Those are your independent and dependent variables.

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:13.020
And be careful with observational studies.

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:15.400
Ice cream sales and sunburns rise together.

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:16.980
Ice cream doesn't cause sunburn.

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:18.100
It's just summer.

00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:19.340
Correlation, by itself,

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:20.520
isn't proof of causation.

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:24.600
A fair comparison controls the other explanations.

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:26.100
